<view class="container">
  <view class="brand">全家管家</view>
  <view class="muted" style="margin-bottom: 40rpx;">白天帮你干活，晚上陪孩子学习，长期管全家健康</view>

  <button class="btn-primary" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="doLogin">微信一键登录</button>

  <view class="card" style="margin-top: 32rpx;">
    <view class="title">{{needBind ? '绑定家庭账号' : '账号密码登录'}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{needBind}}" class="muted" style="margin-bottom: 16rpx;">这个微信还没绑定过。填网页端注册的登录名和密码：点「绑定并登录」把微信与账号绑上，以后打开就直接登录；也可以先用账号密码登录进去。</view>
    <view wx:else class="muted" style="margin-bottom: 16rpx;">微信登录的后端还没部署好时，用网页端同一套账号密码也能登录。</view>
    <input class="field" placeholder="登录名" value="{{identifier}}" bindinput="onIdentifierInput" />
    <input class="field" placeholder="密码" password value="{{password}}" bindinput="onPasswordInput" />
    <button wx:if="{{needBind}}" class="btn-primary" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="doBind">绑定并登录</button>
    <button class="{{needBind ? 'btn-ghost' : 'btn-primary'}}" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="doPasswordLogin" style="margin-top: 12rpx;">账号密码登录</button>
  </view>
</view>
